    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899020/extras/0a8fe4d7f59c8d32d001d190cdf5d4fb.poster.avif?t=1751557687\" width=704 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899020/extras/0a8fe4d7f59c8d32d001d190cdf5d4fb.webm?t=1751557687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899020/extras/0a8fe4d7f59c8d32d001d190cdf5d4fb.mp4?t=1751557687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER INTO THE ULTIMATE POLITICAL ARENA!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a time where politics feel more like a battleground than a debate, <i>Political Punchers</i> transforms the intensity of the political sphere into an exciting 3D fighting game that\u2019s both hilarious and thrilling. As the next presidential election looms on the horizon, it\u2019s time to <i>elect your fighter</i>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARCADE VERSUS MODE</strong>: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends (or foes) in intense player-versus-player or player-vs-computer match-ups. Whether it\u2019s a friendly duel or a heated rivalry, <i>Political Punchers</i> delivers thrilling, competitive 3d fighting game action. Prove your political power and dominate the arena!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>11 PLAYABLE POLITICIAN FIGHTERS</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose from a roster of 8 unique characters (plus 3 unlockable characters), inspired by the political landscape of the USA. Each fighter brings their own unique style and special moves to the battle. Who will you lead to victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>11 PROGRESSIVE STORY LINES</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Embark on 11 different campaigns of political ambition. Navigate your fighter through a series of battles, each a steppingstone on the path to victory. Each character has a unique experience in this hilarious parody on American politics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>10 BATTLE ARENAS</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in combat across 10 distinct 3D stages, each offering a humorous take on the world of politics. Ranging from the revered corridors of the Oval Office to the fortified grounds of a Middle Eastern Military Complex, these arenas provide the ultimate setting for monumental showdowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FREE UPDATES &amp; PLANNED ADDITIONAL CONTENT</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The developer is hard at work adding more unlockable Arenas and Characters, as well as improving the overall game-play experience including mechanics and character balancing.   Check back for frequent updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Download Political Punchers</i></strong> today and <strong>become the next <i>Commander in Chief</i></strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As the political landscape heats up, <i>Political Punchers</i> offers a chance to let off some steam and have a blast with friends. Whether you\u2019re in it for the laughs, the competition, or the chance to play out your political fantasies, this game is a complete knockout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t just watch the election - become part of the action.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899020/extras/0a8fe4d7f59c8d32d001d190cdf5d4fb.poster.avif?t=1751557687\" width=704 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899020/extras/0a8fe4d7f59c8d32d001d190cdf5d4fb.webm?t=1751557687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899020/extras/0a8fe4d7f59c8d32d001d190cdf5d4fb.mp4?t=1751557687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENTER INTO THE ULTIMATE POLITICAL ARENA!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a time where politics feel more like a battleground than a debate, <i>Political Punchers</i> transforms the intensity of the political sphere into an exciting 3D fighting game that\u2019s both hilarious and thrilling. As the next presidential election looms on the horizon, it\u2019s time to <i>elect your fighter</i>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARCADE VERSUS MODE</strong>: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends (or foes) in intense player-versus-player or player-vs-computer match-ups. Whether it\u2019s a friendly duel or a heated rivalry, <i>Political Punchers</i> delivers thrilling, competitive 3d fighting game action. Prove your political power and dominate the arena!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>11 PLAYABLE POLITICIAN FIGHTERS</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose from a roster of 8 unique characters (plus 3 unlockable characters), inspired by the political landscape of the USA. Each fighter brings their own unique style and special moves to the battle. Who will you lead to victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>11 PROGRESSIVE STORY LINES</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Embark on 11 different campaigns of political ambition. Navigate your fighter through a series of battles, each a steppingstone on the path to victory. Each character has a unique experience in this hilarious parody on American politics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>10 BATTLE ARENAS</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in combat across 10 distinct 3D stages, each offering a humorous take on the world of politics. Ranging from the revered corridors of the Oval Office to the fortified grounds of a Middle Eastern Military Complex, these arenas provide the ultimate setting for monumental showdowns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FREE UPDATES &amp; PLANNED ADDITIONAL CONTENT</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The developer is hard at work adding more unlockable Arenas and Characters, as well as improving the overall game-play experience including mechanics and character balancing.   Check back for frequent updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Download Political Punchers</i></strong> today and <strong>become the next <i>Commander in Chief</i></strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As the political landscape heats up, <i>Political Punchers</i> offers a chance to let off some steam and have a blast with friends. Whether you\u2019re in it for the laughs, the competition, or the chance to play out your political fantasies, this game is a complete knockout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t just watch the election - become part of the action.</p>",
    "short_description": "Choose from 11 politician fighters and duke it out across 10 unique stages. Featuring multiplayer match-ups and 11 hilarious single player stories. As the 2024 presidential election approaches, Political Punchers offers a humorous way to make light of the political chaos.",
